1
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,240
=Episode 13=

2
00:00:08,246 --> 00:00:09,542
Be careful with him.

3
00:00:09,542 --> 00:00:10,914
Don't hurt his face.

4
00:00:11,294 --> 00:00:12,095
Don't worry, Chief.

5
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:13,199
Put your weapons down!

6
00:00:13,199 --> 00:00:14,076
Don't hurt him.

7
00:00:17,657 --> 00:00:18,418
So alike.

8
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:19,903
Truly alike.

9
00:00:20,819 --> 00:00:21,542
Eryue,

10
00:00:22,037 --> 00:00:23,866
of all of them, he must be the one
who resembles you most.

11
00:01:05,465 --> 00:01:06,228
Are you alright?

12
00:01:50,646 --> 00:01:51,065
Well?

13
00:01:51,409 --> 00:01:52,627
I pick things up fast, don't I?

14
00:01:52,818 --> 00:01:53,580
You do.

15
00:01:54,303 --> 00:01:55,523
You're so quick-witted.

16
00:01:55,904 --> 00:01:56,742
Now,

17
00:01:56,742 --> 00:01:58,228
the Bandit Stronghold is established.

18
00:01:58,722 --> 00:02:00,246
There's nothing left for me
to teach you.

19
00:02:01,504 --> 00:02:03,103
What's that supposed to mean?

20
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:05,008
Are you leaving?

21
00:02:05,122 --> 00:02:06,609
Are you abandoning us?

22
00:02:08,894 --> 00:02:10,684
This Fengchun Sword
slays all demons on sight.

23
00:02:11,065 --> 00:02:12,057
I'm giving it to you.

24
00:02:12,399 --> 00:02:13,428
It will keep you safe.

25
00:02:14,685 --> 00:02:15,446
In addition,

26
00:02:16,132 --> 00:02:17,657
weapons made from this
Silver Spirit Tree

27
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:19,600
can also slay demon insects.

28
00:02:21,619 --> 00:02:21,922
No.

29
00:02:22,457 --> 00:02:23,523
I don't want this sword.

30
00:02:23,676 --> 00:02:24,703
I want you to stay.

31
00:02:24,742 --> 00:02:25,656
Stay with me, always.

32
00:02:26,570 --> 00:02:27,408
Silly Liuyue,

33
00:02:28,513 --> 00:02:30,190
I will never leave Zhongtu
in this lifetime.

34
00:02:30,494 --> 00:02:31,484
But sometimes,

35
00:02:32,057 --> 00:02:32,970
the bonds between people

36
00:02:33,161 --> 00:02:34,152
are simply fleeting.

37
00:02:34,952 --> 00:02:36,246
People meet, and people part.

38
00:02:36,438 --> 00:02:36,932
Perhaps

39
00:02:37,961 --> 00:02:38,989
there's no need to force it.

40
00:02:40,741 --> 00:02:41,541
I don't care.

41
00:02:41,771 --> 00:02:43,180
All I need is for you to be here.

42
00:02:43,485 --> 00:02:45,161
Let's stay in Zhongtu together,

43
00:02:45,276 --> 00:02:46,151
exterminate every last demon,

44
00:02:46,342 --> 00:02:47,485
and never be apart.

45
00:03:10,227 --> 00:03:10,723
Jin Yunlie!

46
00:03:11,218 --> 00:03:11,980
Let him go!

47
00:03:13,961 --> 00:03:14,800
Let me go!

48
00:03:18,113 --> 00:03:18,532
Come on,

49
00:03:18,989 --> 00:03:19,447
lads!

50
00:03:19,828 --> 00:03:22,457
A toast to my eleventh beautiful groom!

51
00:03:28,666 --> 00:03:30,152
This is what you meant

52
00:03:30,913 --> 00:03:32,361
when you said someone
would guard Zhongtu for you

53
00:03:33,237 --> 00:03:34,875
and they'd all be safe and sound?

54
00:03:35,104 --> 00:03:35,827
I had no idea

55
00:03:36,171 --> 00:03:37,809
that she would turn out like this.

56
00:03:40,437 --> 00:03:41,694
You turned your own dragon bone

57
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,790
into the Fengchun Sword
as a gift for her.

58
00:03:44,246 --> 00:03:46,189
And now she's about to marry
another man.

59
00:03:47,141 --> 00:03:48,056
Doesn't it pain you?

60
00:03:49,999 --> 00:03:51,104
As long as Shenlyu remains,

61
00:03:51,332 --> 00:03:52,095
Xuanji Realm will know no peace.

62
00:03:53,161 --> 00:03:54,303
How could I dare to love her?

63
00:03:55,256 --> 00:03:55,866
Besides,

64
00:03:57,123 --> 00:03:59,333
I don't have much time left anyway.

65
00:04:00,437 --> 00:04:02,266
I believe it's best for me to leave her.

66
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:03,104
You, on the other hand...

67
00:04:03,904 --> 00:04:04,476
Me?

68
00:04:05,084 --> 00:04:05,847
What about me?

69
00:04:05,847 --> 00:04:06,989
Xi Yuan and Jin Yunlie

70
00:04:06,989 --> 00:04:08,819
have long loved each other
without realizing it.

71
00:04:09,504 --> 00:04:10,951
You've watched over her life after life,

72
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:13,009
yet all you can do is
watch her fall for someone else.

73
00:04:14,152 --> 00:04:15,104
Doesn't that ache?

74
00:04:16,476 --> 00:04:18,114
This is simply our fate.

75
00:04:19,257 --> 00:04:20,323
We have no other choice.

76
00:04:21,809 --> 00:04:23,218
Then why ask a question
you already know the answer to?

77
00:04:28,057 --> 00:04:28,818
Indeed.

78
00:04:30,342 --> 00:04:32,094
Why do I ask what I already know?

79
00:04:36,095 --> 00:04:37,694
You mustn't sneak off to Zhongtu

80
00:04:38,151 --> 00:04:39,522
and meddle in their affairs.

81
00:04:40,019 --> 00:04:40,780
I know.

82
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,151
You mustn't either.

83
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,800
Chief, the auspicious hour has come.

84
00:04:53,238 --> 00:04:54,532
The auspicious hour is upon us!

85
00:04:54,532 --> 00:04:55,752
First, bow to heaven and earth!

86
00:04:55,752 --> 00:04:56,400
I object!

87
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:00,894
Well, well.

88
00:05:01,313 --> 00:05:02,608
Speaking in perfect unison.

89
00:05:03,637 --> 00:05:04,971
How interesting.

90
00:05:05,008 --> 00:05:06,075
I'm all ears.

91
00:05:06,075 --> 00:05:07,980
Tell me,
why do you object to this match?

92
00:05:09,351 --> 00:05:10,646
He already has someone he loves.

93
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:12,895
You're basically abducting
a decent young man,

94
00:05:13,009 --> 00:05:13,884
tearing lovers apart.

95
00:05:15,142 --> 00:05:16,360
How about this?

96
00:05:16,476 --> 00:05:17,275
Marry me instead.

97
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:18,838
I'm...

98
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:20,285
more or less the same as him.

99
00:05:25,313 --> 00:05:26,608
Decent-looking, I'll give you that.

100
00:05:26,722 --> 00:05:27,332
However,

101
00:05:27,638 --> 00:05:28,932
you're scrawny.

102
00:05:28,971 --> 00:05:29,580
Can't lift a thing,

103
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:30,608
can't carry a thing.

104
00:05:30,837 --> 00:05:32,476
One finger from me
and you'd be squashed flat.

105
00:05:33,999 --> 00:05:35,333
That's how you see me?

106
00:05:35,561 --> 00:05:36,780
For your information, I happen to be...

107
00:05:36,780 --> 00:05:37,961
The Crown Prince of Xuanhan,

108
00:05:38,151 --> 00:05:39,028
its future king.

109
00:05:41,466 --> 00:05:42,684
You know who I am?

110
00:05:45,351 --> 00:05:46,533
So how dare you...

111
00:05:46,533 --> 00:05:47,751
So what if you're a crown prince?

112
00:05:48,019 --> 00:05:48,932
Here in Zhongtu,

113
00:05:49,351 --> 00:05:50,113
you're nothing more

114
00:05:50,113 --> 00:05:51,980
than a useless man
who can't even best a commoner.

115
00:05:52,322 --> 00:05:53,389
Someone as weak as you are?

116
00:05:53,694 --> 00:05:54,190
I'm not interested.

117
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:54,532
You...

118
00:05:56,476 --> 00:05:57,238
You...

119
00:05:57,618 --> 00:05:58,989
Fine, you may look down on me,

120
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,095
but do you even know

121
00:06:00,209 --> 00:06:01,238
who he is?

122
00:06:01,618 --> 00:06:02,075
Him?

123
00:06:04,742 --> 00:06:05,465
Get up! Get up!

124
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,399
Right,

125
00:06:08,780 --> 00:06:12,666
he must be Jin Yunlie,
the Crown Prince of Huyun Kingdom.

126
00:06:13,314 --> 00:06:14,914
But now that he's fallen into my hands,

127
00:06:14,914 --> 00:06:16,933
he can only be my pretty little groom.

128
00:06:19,142 --> 00:06:19,904
Ji Liuyue,

129
00:06:20,589 --> 00:06:21,923
stop being so obstinate.

130
00:06:22,494 --> 00:06:24,056
If you're willing to let us go,

131
00:06:24,247 --> 00:06:25,390
I can arrange

132
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:26,913
a place of refuge in Huyun for you.

133
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,303
Same here.

134
00:06:30,951 --> 00:06:33,275
Xuanhan Kingdom
is also willing to offer you sanctuary.

135
00:06:33,884 --> 00:06:34,800
Huyun,

136
00:06:35,599 --> 00:06:36,551
Huangyan,

137
00:06:37,047 --> 00:06:38,341
Xuanhan, and Longyuan?

138
00:06:38,723 --> 00:06:40,323
I don't want a thing from any of you.

139
00:06:40,780 --> 00:06:43,371
Back then, you treated us like monsters
and drove us from our homes.

140
00:06:43,446 --> 00:06:45,695
And now you pretend to be the good guys?

141
00:06:46,303 --> 00:06:47,485
Even if we die,

142
00:06:47,523 --> 00:06:49,237
we'll never return to
the four kingdoms of Xuanji Realm!

143
00:06:49,275 --> 00:06:49,465
Yeah!

144
00:06:49,465 --> 00:06:50,646
We'd rather die than go back!

145
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,018
We'd rather die than go back!

146
00:06:52,094 --> 00:06:52,476
That's right!

147
00:06:52,476 --> 00:06:54,304
We're not going back!

148
00:06:54,304 --> 00:06:56,095
Not going back!

149
00:06:56,285 --> 00:06:57,503
We'd rather die than go back!

150
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:00,971
Do you even know

151
00:07:01,771 --> 00:07:03,485
why we ended up stranded in Zhongtu?

152
00:07:04,284 --> 00:07:05,427
I was born in Huyun Kingdom.

153
00:07:06,152 --> 00:07:07,485
Just because I was born
without Spiritual Power,

154
00:07:07,904 --> 00:07:09,465
I wasn't considered a follower
of the Deity

155
00:07:09,999 --> 00:07:11,065
and was cast out.

156
00:07:11,065 --> 00:07:12,065
(What use is living?)

157
00:07:13,771 --> 00:07:14,495
If not for...

158
00:07:15,219 --> 00:07:18,151
this one place in Xuanji Realm,
this land forsaken by the deities...

159
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,485
Every one of us in the Zhongtu Bandits

160
00:08:03,485 --> 00:08:05,200
is what you would call

161
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,075
a traitor to the deities.

162
00:08:06,265 --> 00:08:07,295
Like me,

163
00:08:07,409 --> 00:08:09,656
they were born without Spiritual Power
and forced to eke out a living here.

164
00:08:09,961 --> 00:08:11,219
We were all driven out
by the four kingdoms.

165
00:08:11,219 --> 00:08:12,322
I'm from Longyuan Kingdom!

166
00:08:12,476 --> 00:08:13,923
I was cast out of Huangyan Kingdom!

167
00:08:14,038 --> 00:08:15,332
Xuanhan Kingdom exiled me!

168
00:08:15,523 --> 00:08:17,733
Yeah! Me too! Me too!

169
00:08:18,303 --> 00:08:20,590
The people of the four kingdoms
are all blindly devout to their deities.

170
00:08:20,704 --> 00:08:22,456
Just because we were born
without Spiritual Power,

171
00:08:22,609 --> 00:08:24,171
they hunted us down to the last.

172
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,276
You'd offer sanctuary?

173
00:08:26,304 --> 00:08:27,180
We want none of it.

174
00:08:28,590 --> 00:08:30,075
Relying on this Silver Spirit Tree,

175
00:08:30,189 --> 00:08:31,790
we built this Bandit Stronghold

176
00:08:31,790 --> 00:08:33,238
with our own two hands.

177
00:08:33,999 --> 00:08:34,876
In this lifetime,

178
00:08:35,789 --> 00:08:37,161
we will never again place our hopes

179
00:08:37,161 --> 00:08:39,141
in those ridiculous deities.

180
00:08:41,314 --> 00:08:41,923
Zhongtu,

181
00:08:42,570 --> 00:08:43,714
a land forsaken by the deities,

182
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,123
the Silver Spirit Tree?

183
00:08:47,332 --> 00:08:48,704
The tree planted all those years ago

184
00:08:49,618 --> 00:08:51,066
has taken root and thrived.

185
00:08:51,333 --> 00:08:52,057
That just proves

186
00:08:52,057 --> 00:08:52,857
the deity of Zhongtu

187
00:08:53,352 --> 00:08:54,533
has never abandoned this place.

188
00:08:56,513 --> 00:08:57,504
Yunlie!

189
00:08:57,847 --> 00:08:59,141
Where are you?

190
00:09:00,437 --> 00:09:02,038
I'm so scared!

191
00:09:02,684 --> 00:09:04,132
I'm so scared!

192
00:09:04,475 --> 00:09:05,694
Yunlie!

193
00:09:06,571 --> 00:09:07,599
Yunlie,

194
00:09:07,599 --> 00:09:09,276
I won't run anymore.

195
00:09:09,503 --> 00:09:10,799
I'll never run off again!

196
00:09:10,799 --> 00:09:13,009
Yunlie, I won't run anymore!

197
00:09:15,408 --> 00:09:16,399
Yunlie...

198
00:09:17,161 --> 00:09:17,960
Yunlie!

199
00:09:20,437 --> 00:09:21,200
Come.

200
00:09:24,666 --> 00:09:25,466
Come to me.

201
00:09:26,304 --> 00:09:27,295
Who are you?

202
00:09:27,713 --> 00:09:28,361
Fear not.

203
00:09:29,161 --> 00:09:31,408
I'm the Yellow Dragon,
the deity of this land.

204
00:09:33,656 --> 00:09:35,142
I've waited for you a very long time.

205
00:09:38,838 --> 00:09:39,752
You're lying.

206
00:09:39,904 --> 00:09:42,038
There is no deity in Xuanji Realm
named Yellow Dragon.

207
00:09:44,514 --> 00:09:45,808
To think that after
ten thousand years of dormancy,

208
00:09:46,228 --> 00:09:48,590
the world no longer
even remembers I existed.

209
00:09:49,732 --> 00:09:50,609
So be it.

210
00:10:00,857 --> 00:10:03,600
This is a seed of the Silver Spirit Tree
born of my own heart.

211
00:10:04,171 --> 00:10:05,238
Plant it.

212
00:10:05,541 --> 00:10:07,409
One day, it may save your life.

213
00:10:08,704 --> 00:10:09,122
Here.

214
00:10:13,046 --> 00:10:13,999
And this phone...

215
00:10:16,819 --> 00:10:18,037
It doesn't belong to this world.

216
00:10:18,418 --> 00:10:19,409
It will bring you

217
00:10:19,790 --> 00:10:21,503
the spark of another civilization.

218
00:10:22,266 --> 00:10:22,837
It will bring you

219
00:10:24,057 --> 00:10:25,694
what no deity can bestow,

220
00:10:25,922 --> 00:10:27,752
the hope Xuanhan needs.

221
00:10:36,209 --> 00:10:36,856
He said...

222
00:10:37,008 --> 00:10:38,646
the Silver Spirit Tree
would save my life.

223
00:10:42,152 --> 00:10:43,027
In Zhongtu,

224
00:10:43,865 --> 00:10:45,123
I am the boss.

225
00:10:45,733 --> 00:10:47,866
Some rescue this turned out to be.

226
00:10:48,323 --> 00:10:49,694
I said I'm marrying you,

227
00:10:50,114 --> 00:10:51,484
then you shall marry me.

228
00:10:54,722 --> 00:10:55,485
- Well?
- Xi Yuan!

229
00:10:56,095 --> 00:10:56,741
Will you marry me

230
00:10:57,237 --> 00:10:58,380
or not?

231
00:11:02,684 --> 00:11:03,600
Jin Yunlie,

232
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,360
don't do it!

233
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,246
Now that's more like it.

234
00:11:19,941 --> 00:11:20,704
Enough!

235
00:11:23,257 --> 00:11:23,637
He...

236
00:11:24,057 --> 00:11:25,238
He's already my husband.

237
00:11:25,427 --> 00:11:26,722
Do you still wish to marry him?

238
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:33,720
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit♪

239
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:37,520
♪The envy of everyone♪

240
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:40,880
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions♪

241
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:44,240
♪Leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

242
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:47,600
♪No matter how long or hard our road♪

243
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:50,360
♪I don't care♪

244
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:54,640
♪But you left me with this pain♪

245
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:57,440
♪Forever beyond redemption♪
